<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 384 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 384 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 384 million zlotys of its 273-day NBP-bills after domestic banks bid for 385 million, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield held flat at 19.97 percent, but the minimum price fell 0.01 to 86.84. The average price was 86.85.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
